{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0CUTE and RELAXING MERGE PUZZLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop cute foods into a hot pot, merge them, and try to get higher score until foods overflow out of the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/8fa98fadd1c2ae92750333ee2732fc0b.poster.avif?t=1754390631\" width=300 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/8fa98fadd1c2ae92750333ee2732fc0b.webm?t=1754390631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/8fa98fadd1c2ae92750333ee2732fc0b.mp4?t=1754390631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0OVER 30 UNIQUE ITEMS HELP YOU MAKE the BEST HOT POT EVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level increase provides you the choice of three items that help you much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover synergies, utilize them effectively, and solve the tough situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pencils for drawing obstacle lines </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slingshots for blowing objects off </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Air pumps for making object bigger </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magnets that attracts objects <br> Some has incredible power that changes even game rules...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/cb0c7678feaa3a119fc0ef24127299eb.poster.avif?t=1754390631\" width=300 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/cb0c7678feaa3a119fc0ef24127299eb.webm?t=1754390631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/cb0c7678feaa3a119fc0ef24127299eb.mp4?t=1754390631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0MERGE STREAK FOR MORE ITEMS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up a merge streak to get more exp points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your streak gets bigger and bigger, you'll receive more and more items as rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/30c2cb01d188bf949e05b4503f40473e.poster.avif?t=1754390631\" width=300 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/30c2cb01d188bf949e05b4503f40473e.webm?t=1754390631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2914400/extras/30c2cb01d188bf949e05b4503f40473e.mp4?t=1754390631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a06+ Unique Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Abnormality mode&quot;, you face many variety of abnormalities, for example, an\u00a0eruption, shooting stars, or space travel. 30+ abnormalities await your challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Chestnuts mode&quot;,\u00a0\u00a0obstacle chestnuts spawn over time, you need to cook up fast or a pot will be filled\u00a0uneatable annoying barbed nuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ achievements</p></li><